# VERINEX / GraphHacks
# Commit code, dependency manifests/lockfiles, migrations, synthetic seed data,
# tests, Docker/Compose configuration, and safe *.example configuration files.
# Do not commit live secrets, local databases, generated reports, or runtime state.

